# GREP_SUMMARY: dockerignore template git ds_store env pycache
# region MODULE_CONTRACT
## @purpose  Universal .dockerignore template for ai-platform Docker modules
## @scope    Used by all core/modules/* to exclude non-essential files from Docker build context
## @invariants
##   - Identical across all modules (RC-6: structural deduplication)
##   - After Phase 3.4: modules symlink to this canonical copy
##   - Excludes: git metadata, markdown docs, logs, secrets env, node/python artifacts, macOS dust
## @rationale Single source of truth prevents drift — 5 identical copies existed before templates (RC-6)
# endregion MODULE_CONTRACT

.git/
.gitignore
.DS_Store
.env
*.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
overlays/README.md
